  "solution": {
    "text": "Given equation of curve\n$x=12(t+\\sin t \\cos t), y=12(1+\\sin t)^2$\nDifferentiate w.r.t ' $t$ ',\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{d x}{d t}=12\\left(1+\\cos ^2 t-\\sin ^2 t\\right) \\\\\n& \\frac{d x}{d t}=12(1+\\cos 2 t) \\text { and } \\frac{d y}{d t} \\\\\n& =24(1+\\sin t) \\cos t \\\\\n& \\frac{d y}{d x}=\\frac{2(1+\\sin t) \\times \\cos t}{1+\\cos 2 t}\n\\end{aligned}$",
